  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Ice_Orok_Juggernaut.png\" title=\"Ice Orok Juggernaut\"><img alt=\"Ice Orok Juggernaut\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"231\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Ice_Orok_Juggernaut.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Ice_Orok_Juggernaut.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Ice Orok Juggernaut</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race: </b> Orok\n</p><p><b>Class: </b>Giant Fighter\n</p><p>Juggernauts are freakishly large Oroks armed with an immense log.  These surly giants walk around hefting their huge pieces of timbers and only take it off their shoulder to swat and knock their opponents down.\n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>These guys have a huge knockback and can do major damage with a single blow.  However, usually their endurance is not that high and a concerted attack will finish them off quickly.  They are very vulnerable to AoE attacks and most types take lots of damage from <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Fire\" title=\"Ring of Fire\">Ring of Fire</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Juggernaut\n</td><td>  ---\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storerooms</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Clan of the Cave Yetti</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Orok Juggernaut\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cave Yetti\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Clan of the Cave Yetti</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Juggernaut\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Maximum Security Kremlin</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">J'aymes Fatfilled's Pad</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">Toe-Knee-Eye-Ow-My-Eye's Pad</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GoS] Juggern0t!\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Searing Biggun\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Bernie's Backyard Brawl</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
